<div class="module module-detail md_style1">
	<div class="module-inner">
	<section class="mb">
		<div class="mpgtitle" >
		<h2 class="hdline">[公告] 111-02 學期 EMRD 隨班附讀招生中！112/01/06 (五) 截止</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="mcont">
			

			



<div class="mpgdetail">
	
		
 		
		
		
		
		
	
	
   <div class="meditor"><p><span style="font-size:1.125em;"><strong>111-02 學期 EMRD 隨班附讀&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span><a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/14a9mmFHrd1ous3cHngMomeaDWDWiGx5G/view?usp=share_link" target="_blank" title="簡章"><input name="招生簡章下載" type="button" value="招生簡章下載" /></a></p>

<p>一、報名日期：即日起至&nbsp;<span style="color:#e74c3c;"><strong>111 年 02 月 13&nbsp;日 (一) 止</strong></span></p>

<p>二、報名方式：向 EMRD 辦公室網路報名並匯款報名費，方完成報名程序。&nbsp;</p>

<p>三、報名資格：須具有報考碩士學位學歷資格（國內經教育部立案之各公私立大學校院</p>

<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 或獨立學院學士班應屆畢業生或具有學士學位者或合於同等學力者）。</p>

<p>四、報名手續：<span style="font-size:12pt">以下資料請填妥後，請掃描成&nbsp;<span style="color:#e74c3c;"><b>一份 PDF&nbsp;</b><b>電子檔格式</b>&nbsp;</span>以 e-mail 方式</span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 寄至&nbsp;<a href="mailto:emrd@mail.ntust.edu.tw?subject=%E5%A0%B1%E5%90%8D%20EMRD%20%E5%9C%A8%E8%81%B7%E5%B0%88%E7%8F%AD%C2%A0111-02%C2%A0%E9%9A%A8%E7%8F%AD%E9%99%84%E8%AE%80%20(%E8%AB%8B%E5%A1%AB%E5%A7%93%E5%90%8D)" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">emrd@mail.ntust.edu.tw</a>，或以&nbsp;<span style="color:#e74c3c;"><b>網路報名</b></span><span style="font-size:12pt">。</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="color:#e74c3c;"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b></span>網路報名連結請參考網址：<a href="https://forms.gle/PKth5Rqchc4B3xcx6" style="color:blue; text-decoration:underline">https://forms.gle/PKth5Rqchc4B3xcx6</a>。</span><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(1) </span><span style="line-height:110%">報名表</span><span style="line-height:110%"> (附表一</span><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">)</span><span style="line-height:110%">。</span><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span>(2) </span><span style="line-height:110%">切結書</span><span style="line-height:110%"> (</span><span style="line-height:110%">附表二</span><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">)</span><span style="line-height:110%">。</span><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span></p>

