<p>五、報名費：</p>

<div>
<p><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="line-height:110%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="text-justify:inter-ideograph"><span style="line-height:110%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>​<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">(1) </span><span style="color:#e74c3c;"><b><span style="line-height:110%">報名費&nbsp;</span></b><b><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">500&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style="line-height:110%">元</span></b></span><span style="line-height:110%">，不收現金。可使用&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%">ATM&nbsp;</span><span style="line-height:110%">或網路銀行轉帳，跨行轉帳手續費需自行負擔。</span><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:110%"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height:110%"></span></span></span></p>

